<section class="phero"><img class="phero-bg" src="/assets/img/photos/roofer.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofer-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofer.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="802" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><div class="phero-shade"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">Appraisals</span></nav><p class="kicker">What we appraise</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Services Across New York</h1><p class="lede">From a one-time estimate review to full panel representation and neutral umpire work, every service is built around an accurate, defensible valuation of the loss.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-orange" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-ghost-l" href="/reach-us/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="card-grid three" data-stagger><a class="card wide-card rv" href="/claim-appraisals/appraisal-panel-representation/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consult.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consult-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consult.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">01</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Appraisal Clause Representation</b><span>We act as your named appraiser after either side invokes the appraisal clause in a New York property policy.</span><em>Details <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card wide-card rv" href="/claim-appraisals/homeowners-insurance-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/who-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/who-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/who-home.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">02</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Homeowners Claim Appraisal</b><span>Independent valuation of dwelling, garage, fence and contents losses for New York houses, rowhouses and two-families.</span><em>Details <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card wide-card rv" href="/claim-appraisals/co-op-condo-commercial-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/apartment.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/apartment-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/apartment.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">03</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Co-op, Condo &amp; Commercial Appraisal</b><span>Appraisal for co-op boards, condo associations, managing agents, mixed-use, retail and multifamily owners in New York.</span><em>Details <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card wide-card rv" href="/claim-appraisals/roof-hail-damage-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hail.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hail-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hail.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">04</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</b><span>Independent hail damage appraisal for roofs, siding, gutters and skylights across the Hudson Valley, Capital Region and Western NY.</span><em>Details <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card wide-card rv" href="/claim-appraisals/windstorm-tornado-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fallen-tree.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fallen-tree-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fallen-tree.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="576" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">05</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Windstorm &amp; Tornado Appraisal</b><span>Wind damage appraisal after derechos, microbursts, tornadoes and severe thunderstorms anywhere in New York State.</span><em>Details <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card wide-card rv" href="/claim-appraisals/hurricane-noreaster-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/waves.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/waves-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/waves.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">06</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Hurricane &amp; Nor’easter Appraisal</b><span>Hurricane claim appraisal for coastal New York, with careful attention to wind versus surge and percentage deductibles.</span><em>Details <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card wide-card rv" href="/claim-appraisals/burst-pipe-water-damage-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="795" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">07</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Water Damage Appraisal</b><span>Water damage claim appraisal for burst and frozen pipes, appliance leaks, unit-to-unit leaks and sewer backup losses in NY.</span><em>Details <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card wide-card rv" href="/claim-appraisals/fire-smoke-damage-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="685" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">08</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</b><span>Fire damage appraisal for New York homes and attached buildings, including smoke migration, contents and living expenses.</span><em>Details <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card wide-card rv" href="/claim-appraisals/snow-load-ice-dam-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/icicles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/icicles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/icicles.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="685" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">09</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Snow Load &amp; Ice Dam Appraisal</b><span>Ice dam claim appraisal for lake-effect snow, roof collapse and freeze-up losses, a distinctly New York kind of claim.</span><em>Details <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card wide-card rv" href="/claim-appraisals/carrier-estimate-review/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">10</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Insurance Estimate Review</b><span>An independent insurance estimate review that shows where the carrier’s number falls short before you decide on appraisal.</span><em>Details <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card wide-card rv" href="/claim-appraisals/appraisal-umpire-services/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consult2.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consult2-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consult2.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">11</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Umpire Services</b><span>Neutral insurance appraisal umpire services for New York panels where the two appraisers cannot agree on the amount of loss.</span><em>Details <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap faq-split"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most files begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that difference is worth. A review answers that in days, and many disputes close at that stage with a documented supplement.</p><a class="btn btn-blue" href="/claim-appraisals/carrier-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one part of the process?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Many owners start with an estimate review and decide later whether to invoke appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you work on co-op and condo buildings?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. We work for unit owners and for boards and managing agents, and we sort out which policy responds to which part of the loss.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle flood claims?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Flood is excluded from standard homeowners policies. We can review flood estimates, but appraisal under a flood policy follows that policy’s own, narrower rules.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-strip"><div class="wrap"><div><h2>Covered, but not paid in full?</h2><p>Send us the carrier’s estimate and your photos. We’ll read it line by line and tell you what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-orange" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-ghost-l" href="/reach-us/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
</main>
